    "description": {
      "value": "<p class=\"feature\"><em><strong>Life Drain.</strong></em></p><p><em>Constitution Saving Throw:</em> DC [[lookup @save.dc.value activity=FA4Mt9cXsYfHDDcs]], one [[lookup @target.affects.type activity=FA4Mt9cXsYfHDDcs]] within [[lookup @range.value activity=FA4Mt9cXsYfHDDcs]] feet.</p><p><em>Failure:</em> [[/damage average]] damage, and the target's Hit Point maximum decreases by an amount equal to the damage taken.</p><p class=\"feature\">A Humanoid slain by this attack rises 24 hours later as a <strong>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.actors24.Actor.mmZombie00000000]{Zombie}</strong> under the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster}'s control, unless the Humanoid is restored to life or its body is destroyed. The [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster} can have no more than twelve zombies under its control at a time.</p><div class=\"cat-description\"><p><em>midi-qol: On a failed save the target's Hit Point maximum drops by the damage taken (as negative temporary maximum, restored by a Long Rest); a maximum of 0 kills it. Rising as a Zombie is left to the GM.</em></p><p><em>Automation requires Coven's Automation Toolkit (CAT).</em></p></div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
